{
  "manifestVersion": "rc8.14_deps_v1",
  "targetEnv": "fanshen002-d9g0rjr3b6e313af5",
  "note": "Minimal dependency set actually read/written by the 3 challenge business functions (getChallengeEvent, startChallenge, submitChallengeChoice) plus their bundled lib/ and common/ deps, for the real C1–C10 run. Read-only collections are created EMPTY so no query can fail with -502005 'Table not exist'. Collections are NEVER dropped or cleared; data is never overwritten.",
  "seededElsewhere": [
